<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span>Count of ReAct trajectories by question type. Each row represents a distinct trajectory executed by the ReAct agent, and the columns indicate the number of questions of each type that followed the corresponding trajectory. “–” indicates no questions of that type were associated with the trajectory. <span id="A1.T8.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bolded</span> tool names within trajectories denote that the tool was invoked with incorrect parameters. <span id="A1.T8.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Italicized<sup id="A1.T8.6.1" class="ltx_sup">∗</sup></span> tool names indicate that the tool was called unnecessarily, i.e., its output was not required for answering the question.</figcaption>
</figure>
